amount of absorption of food.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.680
But the interesting part
about bariatric surgery

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.850
and why we recommend it,

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:46.020
it's really the only form
of lasting weight loss

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.600
that we have really good evidence for.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.580
Other ways in which people lose weight,

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.220
five to 10 years later, doesn't
seem to be as effective.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.600
They seem to put that weight back on.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.030
But with bariatric surgery,
the results seem to hold

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.470
in a decent amount of the cases.

